<!-- ═══ SECTION 5: QUICK TIP ═══ -->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
  <td style="padding:32px 36px;border-bottom:1px solid #E8E8E8;">

    <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0972D3;margin:0 0 12px 0;">&#128161; Quick Tip</p>

    <h2 style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;color:#232F3E;margin:0 0 20px 0;letter-spacing:-0.3px;">The Three-Disposition Test</h2>

    <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#232F3E;margin:0 0 20px 0;">Take a name match against an OFAC SDN entry for <strong style="font-weight:700;">Ahmed Hassan Mohammed</strong>, listed at Damascus, Syria. Three payments arrive. This is what structured addresses do to each one &#8212; deterministically, at the field level, with a full audit log:</p>

    <!-- Disposition 1: Auto-Clear -->
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 10px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td style="background:#F1F8F2;border:1px solid #C8E6C9;border-radius:6px;padding:16px 20px;">
        <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#2E7D32;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px;margin:0 0 6px 0;">Auto-Clear</p>
        <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#232F3E;margin:0;">Payment to <em>Ahmed Hassan Mohammed, London, GB</em>. Country field is GB. SDN entry country is SY. Country mismatch. The disposition is logged at the field level, fully auditable. No analyst time required.</p>
      </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- Disposition 2: Downgrade -->
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 10px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td style="background:#FFFBF2;border:1px solid #F5DEB3;border-radius:6px;padding:16px 20px;">
        <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#E65100;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px;margin:0 0 6px 0;">Downgrade</p>
        <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#232F3E;margin:0;">Payment to <em>Al Rashid Trading Co, Erbil, Iraq</em>. Country field is IQ &#8212; matches the region. City field is Erbil, not Damascus. Partial match: lighter-touch review rather than full escalation. The analyst sees exactly why.</p>
      </td>
